格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Multi-channel decision and remote-control bridge for DeepSeek Harness: pushes any workspace's approval/question cards to IM channels (WeChat iLink first) and answers them from chat, with a session console, per-channel security and an open push service. Maintenance status: FROZEN ","id":"gh:1355989130","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-reach","slug":"PerryLink/dsh-reach","topics":["ai-agent","ai-agents","approval","bridge","chatops","clawbot","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh","dsh-plugin","feishu","ilink","im","messaging","notify","remote-control","wechat"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Multi-channel decision and remote-control bridge for DeepSeek Harness: pushes any workspace's approv"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"al/question cards to IM channels (WeChat iLink first) and answers them from chat, with a session con"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"sole, per-channel security and an open push service. Maintenance status: FROZEN "},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-reach"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Multi-channel decision & remote-control bridge for DeepSeek Harness (DSH).**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Pushes any workspace's approval/question cards to IM channels (WeChat iLink, Telegram, Feishu — plus"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" QQ/DingTalk/WeCom v2 drop-in foundations) and answers them from chat, with a session console, per-c"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"hannel security, and an open push service."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"简体中文 · Español · Português · हिन्दी"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Community plugin, not affiliated with DeepSeek. Canonical repository: <https://github.com/PerryLink/"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"dsh-reach> (Gitee is a mirror)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Restart DSH after installation (bundle patches apply at startup)."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## ⭐ 如果它帮到了你"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"这个插件是 DSH 插件家族的一员（95 个，全部 Apache-2.0）。如果你在用，**给个 star** —— 它不会解锁任何功能，但会让下一个人在搜索里更容易找到它。"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"*English:* part of a 95 plugin family for DeepSeek Harness. If it is useful, **a star helps the next"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" person find it** — nothing is gated behind it."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## What is dsh-reach?"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Full evidence, including the host-version compatibility matrix: `dsh-plugin-supersession-review-2026"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ence, including the host-version compatibility matrix: `dsh-plugin-supersession-review-20261005.md`."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"*Structure: two banks and one round trip. A DSH waterfall (`approval/request` / `user-questions/requ"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"est`) holds a deferred promise; the bridge renders `P{n}` + `#token`, queues the card per user under"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" the send budget, and `adapterFor(chatId)` routes it to one of six channel adapters. The reply cross"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"es the fail-closed gate and the decision parser, then resolves the held promise; timeout, abort, and"},{"id":"p17s5","text":" unload have explicit exits. Solid arrows are card out on the top lane and decision back on the bott"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"om lane; dashed arrows connect the pending ledger.*"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Maintenance status: 🧊 FROZEN"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> **Frozen on 2026-10-05. No new features.** This package still works, and it is not retired — but i"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"t no longer receives feature work. Only a genuine breakage will be fixed."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**Release: v0.1.24** — Phase 1–3 channels complete (WeChat iLink, Telegram, Feishu); QQ / DingTalk /"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" WeCom are v2 foundations on the open `reachChannels` registry."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Maintainers treat this capability as one where **the ecosystem has converged on a more widely adopte"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"d implementation**, so effort has moved elsewhere. The comparison below was measured on 2026-10-05 a"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"nd is recorded so nobody has to redo it."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| | package | weekly downloads |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| **this package** | `dsh-reach` | 600 |\n| more widely adopted implementation | `@xmanrui/dsh-im` | "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"kage** | `dsh-reach` | 600 |\n| more widely adopted implementation | `@xmanrui/dsh-im` | **17,384** |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"**Why it is the mainstream choice.** `@xmanrui/dsh-im` provides ten channels — WeChat, Feishu, WeCom"},{"id":"p24s2","text":", DingTalk, QQ, Telegram, WhatsApp, Slack, Discord and Matrix."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**Compatibility.** declares no dsh peers, so the compatibility guard never blocks it."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**What this package still does that the alternatives do not.** this package's differentiator was tha"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"t the same bridge carried approvals and questions back into chat; the rival is broader in channel co"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"same bridge carried approvals and questions back into chat; the rival is broader in channel coverage"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"👉 **For new work, @xmanrui/dsh-im is the mainstream choice.** Existing installs keep working unchang"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ed; nothing is being removed."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"*Full evidence, including the host-version compatibility matrix: `dsh-plugin-supersession-review-202"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"nce, including the host-version compatibility matrix: `dsh-plugin-supersession-review-20261005.md`.*"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Surface | Status |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Harness | DeepSeek Harness **dsh-v0.2.1-alpha.1** (GitHub tag). Peer range `>=0.1.2-rc.1 <0.2.0 \\|"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"\\| >=0.1.5-alpha.1 <0.2.0 \\|\\| >=0.1.6-0 <0.2.0 \\|\\| >=0.1.7-0 <0.2.0`; the dev/test pins deliberate"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"ly stay on the published `0.1.7-rc.2` line, which is the face the `typecheck:ci` ruler measures (the"},{"id":"p31s4","text":" plain `typecheck` ruler measures the checkout through `tsconfig.json` `paths`). Verified 2026-09-24"},{"id":"p31s5","text":" with the full gate chain; the bare-import + scratch-profile + keyless smoke run in the Compat workf"},{"id":"p31s6","text":"low on every PR. |\n| Node | `^22.19.0 \\|\\| >=24.0.0` |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Features (Phase 1)"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- **Cross-session decision push**: approval/question cards from ANY workspace\nare mirrored to WeChat"},{"id":"p33s2","text":" (iLink/ClawBot) with stable `#token` ids and `P{n}`\nnumbering; reply `1`/`2`, `P1=1 P2=2`, `P1=Q1=2"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"`, or `/rp` `/rq` — answered\nthrough the native pending waterfall (first reply wins with the GUI).\n-"},{"id":"p33s4","text":" **Fail-closed security**: first sender becomes the owner; empty allowlists\ndeny everyone; unknown s"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"enders are audited and never answered.\n- **Session console**: `/status /silent /notify /tasks /enter"},{"id":"p33s6","text":" /history /stop\n/next /help` plus native DSH command passthrough.\n- **Proactive push**: the `reach_s"},{"id":"p33s7","text":"end` tool with an outbound file fence; rate\nbudget + FIFO re-queue; silent mode; background completi"},{"id":"p33s8","text":"on notices.\n- **Settings tab**: Settings → Plugins → IM Bridge (status, switches,\nre-scan/logout).\n-"},{"id":"p33s9","text":" **Open channel registry**: third-party plugins register a channel via\n`ctx.get('reachChannels').reg"},{"id":"p33s10","text":"isterChannel({ id, adapter, priority,\nownsChatId, startMonitor })`; routing, outbound, and monitor l"},{"id":"p33s11","text":"ifecycle are\nall bridge-owned (QQ/DingTalk/WeCom ride this same path)."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"### Examples"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"These are the plugin's real entry points; install once, then call one."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"##